 src/pages/comparatifs/index.astro | 39 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 src/pages/concepts/[id].astro     |  2 +-
 src/pages/concepts/index.astro    | 35 ++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 src/pages/releases/[id].astro     |  2 +-
 src/pages/tutoriels/[id].astro    |  2 +-
 9 files changed, 94 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

